@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Frontend classes - Close a sprint and resolve unfinished work
top to bottom direction
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
class SprintBoardPage {
  -header: WritableSignal<ActiveSprintHeader?>
  +draft: Signal<DraftState>
  +openCloseSprint(sprintId: Guid): void
}
note left of SprintBoardPage
Close sprint in the header card passes
header().sprintId from BoardView
sprintLoaded (execute-sprint-work);
a StartSprintOutcome CloseSprint passes
the sprint it names; offerSprintsLink = true.
Closed, Outdated, unconfirmed and forbidden:
as for SprintsPage (Outdated rereads the board).
end note
class SprintsPage {
  +draft: Signal<DraftState>
  +openCloseSprint(sprintId: Guid): void
}
class SprintPlanningPage {
  +draft: Signal<DraftState>
  +openCloseSprint(sprintId: Guid): void
}
note right of SprintsPage
SprintListView emits closeRequested(sprintId)
from the active sprint card (plan-sprints);
SprintPlanningPage opens the dialog only for a
StartSprintOutcome CloseSprint. offerSprintsLink:
false from SprintsPage (the dialog is over the
Sprints tab), true from SprintPlanningPage.
Each page:
Closed -> open its history with the
"Sprint 8 closed" toast and counts;
Outdated -> own counter + 1 (reread);
while the dialog is open: unconfirmed ->
counter + 1 at once; forbidden -> "Your
access changed" toast, without Retry.
All delegate draft to the open dialog;
SprintsPage and SprintBoardPage fall back
to inject(ProjectLayoutPage).draft().
end note
class ProjectLayoutPage {
  +refresh(): void
}
note left of ProjectLayoutPage
When ModeChangeDialog closes with
CloseSprint(SprintReference) (change-delivery-mode),
the layout opens the dialog with its sprintId;
offerSprintsLink = active child route is not
sprints. Closed -> refresh()
and the "Sprint 8 closed" toast with its counts;
Outdated -> refresh(); while the dialog is
open: unconfirmed -> refresh() at once;
forbidden -> "Your access changed" toast,
without Retry.
end note
class CloseSprintDialog {
  +sprintId: InputSignal<Guid>
  +offerSprintsLink: InputSignal<boolean>
  +draft: Signal<DraftState>
  +unconfirmed: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +forbidden: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +requestClose(): Promise<void>
  +close(outcome: CloseSprintOutcome?): void
}
note right of CloseSprintDialog
Passes sprintId and offerSprintsLink to the form.
close(Closed(result)) on closed; close(Outdated)
when it closes after outdated, or at once on
notFound; close() on cancelled, Close or Escape
means dismissed.
draft = latest draftChange of the form.
Relays the form's unconfirmed and forbidden
as its own outputs and stays open with every
choice.
Cancel, Close or Escape on a dirty draft opens
UnsavedChangesDialog (CancelForm).
end note
class CloseSprintOutcome {
  +kind: Closed | Outdated
  +closed: SprintCloseResult?
}
class SprintCloseResult {
  +sprintId: Guid
  +name: string
  +historyRoute: string
  +doneCount: int
  +returnedCount: int
  +carriedOver: CarryoverCount[]
}
class SprintClosureForm {
  +sprintId: InputSignal<Guid>
  +offerSprintsLink: InputSignal<boolean>
  -review: ResourceRef<SprintClosureReview>
  -page: WritableSignal<int>
  -setAllTo: WritableSignal<CarryoverDestination?>
  -overrides: WritableSignal<Map<Guid, CarryoverDestination>>
  -reviewedVersion: WritableSignal<long>
  +closed: OutputEmitterRef<SprintCloseResult>
  +outdated: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +notFound: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +unconfirmed: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +forbidden: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +cancelled: OutputEmitterRef<void>
  +draftChange: OutputEmitterRef<DraftState>
  +submit(): Promise<void>
}
note right of SprintClosureForm
Close sprint stays disabled until the review resolves;
a failed read offers Try again = review.reload() and Cancel.
A 409 for a sprint that is not Active (Planned or Closed)
shows already-closed naming its state and emits outdated;
a 404 emits notFound; an unexpected 403 keeps every
choice and emits forbidden. No response on close: "We couldn't
confirm whether Sprint 8 closed"; emits unconfirmed; review
read once: Closed shows the neutral "Sprint 8 is closed now."
(unconfirmed-closed) and emits outdated.
draftChange is dirty once Set all or an override is chosen.
View sprints renders only while offerSprintsLink is true;
without it, Close is the first action and takes focus.
Story titles and View sprints are router links: with
choices made, leaving asks first; the dialog then closes
with no result once the navigation completes.
end note
interface ISprintService {
  +closureReviewResource(query: () => GetSprintClosureReviewQuery | undefined): ResourceRef<SprintClosureReview>
  +close(command: CloseSprintCommand): Promise<SprintCloseResult>
}
note right of ISprintService
The review is a caller-owned signal resource;
it aborts a superseded page read. Close returns
a promise. No RxJS type crosses api.
end note
class SprintService {
  -http: HttpClient
}
SprintBoardPage ..> CloseSprintDialog : opens with header().sprintId
SprintsPage ..> CloseSprintDialog : opens from closeRequested(sprintId)
SprintPlanningPage ..> CloseSprintDialog : opens on StartSprintOutcome CloseSprint
ProjectLayoutPage ..> CloseSprintDialog : opens on ModeChangeOutcome CloseSprint(sprint)
CloseSprintDialog --> SprintClosureForm : composes
CloseSprintDialog ..> CloseSprintOutcome : close result
CloseSprintOutcome --> SprintCloseResult
SprintClosureForm ..> ISprintService : inject token
ISprintService <|.. SprintService
@enduml
